      "description": "Age of the newest BMS frame. The OBD logger only runs while the car is awake, so this grows whenever the car simply is not being driven -- a three-day gap over 2026-08-31 to 09-02 was exactly that, a car sitting still. Absence here is NOT a fault, which is why no alert rule watches it and why the tile carries no red threshold.\n\nFixed 30-day lookback rather than the dashboard time range, so the tile still reports an age when the picker is set to a window with no data in it.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
