    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "P3C6603E967DC8568"
      },
      "description": "Cold-start pressure for the front-left tyre: the first fresh TPMS frame after a park of 6 h or more, when the tyre has actually reached ambient.\n\nThis tile used to show the RAW, temperature-uncompensated sensor pressure while the alert rules read the cold-start series, so the tile could sit green while an alert was firing, or turn amber straight after a motorway run on a tyre that was perfectly fine. It now reads the SAME series the ioniq-tpms-<wheel>-psi-low and -psi-crit rules read, so colour and alert state cannot disagree.\n\nThe value can be up to a day or two old -- it needs an overnight park and the car is not driven every day. For live pressure and the four-wheel trends, follow the Ioniq EV link to the Tires dashboard.\n\nPlacard is 2.5 bar at ambient. Thresholds match the alert rules: warning under 2.20 bar, critical under 1.90 bar, over-inflated above 2.90 bar.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1.9
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 2.2
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2.9
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "suffix: bar"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "9.5.2",
      "targets": [
